# A `pin` line carrying none of at=, width= and height= declares nothing,
# so it is a line error rather than a weaker constraint (`ELEMENT-GEOMETRY-DIRECTIVE`). The second
# line pins that the extent keys resolve their id like every other
# reference: an id that names nothing is an error, never a synthesized
# element (§12.4 rule 8).
figdown 0.1 block
node a "A"
pin a
pin ghost width=10
